---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Richiedi una valutazione | Crepe in Casa"
  description="Prepara una richiesta strutturata sulle crepe o fessurazioni osservate nel tuo immobile. Il form crea un riepilogo neutro e non formula diagnosi."
  canonical="https://crepeincasa.it/richiedi-valutazione/"
>
  <article class="lead-page">
    <header class="lead-hero">
      <div class="container lead-hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Richiesta strutturata</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">Racconta ciò che hai osservato</h1>
        <p class="lead-intro">
          In pochi passaggi puoi raccogliere le informazioni principali sul tuo immobile e sulle crepe
          o fessurazioni che hai notato. Il risultato sarà un riepilogo neutro, non una diagnosi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container lead-layout">
      <div class="lead-main">
        <form class="lead-form" data-lead-form>
          <div class="form-progress" data-progress aria-live="polite">
            <div class="progress-heading">
              <span class="eyebrow">Il tuo percorso</span>
              <span data-progress-label>Passo 1 di 4</span>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-track" aria-hidden="true"><span data-progress-bar></span></div>
          </div>

          <p class="form-status" data-form-status role="status"></p>

          <fieldset data-step="0">
            <legend>Immobile</legend>
            <p class="fieldset-intro">Dove si trova l’immobile e di che tipo è?</p>
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="field field-wide">
                <label for="comune">Comune <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <input id="comune" name="comune" type="text" autocomplete="address-level2" required />
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="provincia">Provincia <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <input id="provincia" name="provincia" type="text" maxlength="2" autocomplete="address-level1" required />
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cap">CAP <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <input id="cap" name="cap" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{5}" maxlength="5" autocomplete="postal-code" required />
              </div>
              <div class="field field-wide">
                <label for="tipologia">Tipologia di immobile <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <select id="tipologia" name="tipologia" required>
                  <option value="">Seleziona un’opzione</option>
                  <option>Casa indipendente</option>
                  <option>Appartamento</option>
                  <option>Edificio plurifamiliare</option>
                  <option>Locale commerciale o produttivo</option>
                  <option>Altro</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="anno">Anno approssimativo</label>
                <input id="anno" name="anno" type="number" min="1000" max="2026" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Es. 1980" />
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="piani">Numero di piani</label>
                <select id="piani" name="piani">
                  <option value="">Non indicato</option>
                  <option>1</option>
                  <option>2</option>
                  <option>3</option>
                  <option>4 o più</option>
                  <option>Non so</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset data-step="1" hidden>
            <legend>Osservazioni</legend>
            <p class="fieldset-intro">Descrivi quello che hai visto, senza cercare di interpretarlo.</p>
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="field field-full">
                <label for="dove">Dove sono le crepe o fessurazioni? <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <textarea id="dove" name="dove" rows="3" required placeholder="Es. parete del soggiorno, vicino alla finestra"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="field field-wide">
                <label for="interno-esterno">Sono interne o esterne? <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <select id="interno-esterno" name="internoEsterno" required>
                  <option value="">Seleziona un’opzione</option>
                  <option>Interne</option>
                  <option>Esterne</option>
                  <option>Sia interne sia esterne</option>
                  <option>Non so</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="orientamento">Orientamento, se noto</label>
                <input id="orientamento" name="orientamento" type="text" placeholder="Es. verticale, diagonale" />
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="comparsa">Quando sono comparse?</label>
                <select id="comparsa" name="comparsa">
                  <option value="">Non indicato</option>
                  <option>Da pochi giorni</option>
                  <option>Da alcuni mesi</option>
                  <option>Da più di un anno</option>
                  <option>Non so</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cambiamenti">Sembrano cambiare?</label>
                <select id="cambiamenti" name="cambiamenti">
                  <option value="">Non indicato</option>
                  <option>Sì, secondo la mia osservazione</option>
                  <option>No, non ho notato cambiamenti</option>
                  <option>Non so</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="porte-finestre">Problemi a porte o finestre?</label>
                <select id="porte-finestre" name="porteFinestre">
                  <option value="">Non indicato</option>
                  <option>Sì</option>
                  <option>No</option>
                  <option>Non so</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="pavimenti">Pavimenti apparentemente fuori livello?</label>
                <select id="pavimenti" name="pavimenti">
                  <option value="">Non indicato</option>
                  <option>Sì</option>
                  <option>No</option>
                  <option>Non so</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="lavori">Lavori recenti?</label>
                <select id="lavori" name="lavori">
                  <option value="">Non indicato</option>
                  <option>Sì</option>
                  <option>No</option>
                  <option>Non so</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="infiltrazioni">Infiltrazioni o umidità osservate?</label>
                <select id="infiltrazioni" name="infiltrazioni">
                  <option value="">Non indicato</option>
                  <option>Sì</option>
                  <option>No</option>
                  <option>Non so</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field field-full">
                <label for="note">Note aggiuntive</label>
                <textarea id="note" name="note" rows="4" placeholder="Aggiungi dettagli che ritieni utili, senza formulare conclusioni"></textarea>
              </div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset data-step="2" hidden>
            <legend>Richiesta</legend>
            <p class="fieldset-intro">Qual è il motivo principale per cui stai raccogliendo queste informazioni?</p>
            <div class="choice-list">
              <label class="choice-card">
                <input type="radio" name="richiesta" value="Sopralluogo" required />
                <span><strong>Sopralluogo</strong><small>Vorrei capire se può essere utile una verifica sul posto.</small></span>
              </label>
              <label class="choice-card">
                <input type="radio" name="richiesta" value="Valutazione del problema" />
                <span><strong>Valutazione del problema</strong><small>Vorrei confrontarmi sul contesto che ho osservato.</small></span>
              </label>
              <label class="choice-card">
                <input type="radio" name="richiesta" value="Preventivo per un intervento" />
                <span><strong>Preventivo per un intervento</strong><small>Vorrei informazioni su un possibile lavoro, senza indicare una tecnica.</small></span>
              </label>
              <label class="choice-card">
                <input type="radio" name="richiesta" value="Non so" />
                <span><strong>Non so ancora</strong><small>Vorrei solo mettere in ordine le osservazioni.</small></span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset data-step="3" hidden>
            <legend>Contatti</legend>
            <p class="fieldset-intro">Lascia un recapito per poter gestire la richiesta. Non usare questi campi per informazioni urgenti.</p>
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="field field-wide">
                <label for="nome">Nome <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <input id="nome" name="nome" type="text" autocomplete="name" required />
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="email">Email <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="telefono">Telefono</label>
                <input id="telefono" name="telefono" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="consent-box">
              <label class="checkbox-row">
                <input id="consenso-inoltro" name="consensoInoltro" type="checkbox" value="Sì" />
                <span>Acconsento, in modo separato e facoltativo, all’eventuale inoltro del riepilogo a partner attivi e compatibili con la mia zona e il tipo di richiesta.</span>
              </label>
              <p>
                Il consenso non è preselezionato. In questa versione di sviluppo non viene inviata alcuna email
                e non viene effettuato alcun inoltro reale.
              </p>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="form-actions">
            <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-back hidden>Indietro</button>
            <button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-next>Continua <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
            <button class="button button-primary" type="submit" data-submit hidden>Prepara il riepilogo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <section class="summary-card" data-summary hidden aria-labelledby="summary-title">
          <p class="eyebrow">Risultato</p>
          <h2 id="summary-title">Riepilogo delle osservazioni fornite dall’utente</h2>
          <p class="summary-intro">Controlla le informazioni qui sotto. Il riepilogo non stabilisce la causa della crepa e non sostituisce una verifica sul posto.</p>
          <dl data-summary-list></dl>
          <p class="summary-note" data-summary-note></p>
          <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-restart>Modifica le informazioni</button>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="lead-aside">
        <div class="aside-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Prima di iniziare</p>
          <h2>Una descrizione neutra è sufficiente.</h2>
          <p>Non devi conoscere termini tecnici né scegliere una soluzione. Indica ciò che hai visto e ciò che ricordi.</p>
          <a class="inline-link" href="/crepe-nei-muri/">Leggi prima la guida <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="aside-note">
          <strong>Attenzione</strong>
          <p>Questo modulo non è un servizio di emergenza e non valuta se un edificio sia sicuro o pericoloso.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import { createMockLeadAdapter } from '../../lib/lead/mockAdapter';

  const form = document.querySelector('[data-lead-form]');
  const steps = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]'));
  const nextButton = document.querySelector('[data-next]');
  const backButton = document.querySelector('[data-back]');
  const submitButton = document.querySelector('[data-submit]');
  const progressLabel = document.querySelector('[data-progress-label]');
  const progressBar = document.querySelector('[data-progress-bar]');
  const formStatus = document.querySelector('[data-form-status]');
  const summary = document.querySelector('[data-summary]');
  const summaryList = document.querySelector('[data-summary-list]');
  const summaryNote = document.querySelector('[data-summary-note]');
  const restartButton = document.querySelector('[data-restart]');
  const adapter = createMockLeadAdapter();
  let currentStep = 0;

  const valueOf = (name) => {
    const field = form?.elements.namedItem(name);
    if (!field || typeof field.value !== 'string') return '';
    return field.value.trim();
  };

  const displayValue = (value) => value || 'Non indicato';

  const validateStep = () => {
    const fields = steps[currentStep].querySelectorAll('input, select, textarea');
    for (const field of fields) {
      if (!field.checkValidity()) {
        field.reportValidity();
        return false;
      }
    }
    return true;
  };

  const showStep = (stepIndex) => {
    currentStep = stepIndex;
    steps.forEach((step, index) => {
      step.hidden = index !== currentStep;
    });
    if (progressLabel) progressLabel.textContent = `Passo ${currentStep + 1} di ${steps.length}`;
    if (progressBar) progressBar.style.width = `${((currentStep + 1) / steps.length) * 100}%`;
    if (backButton) backButton.hidden = currentStep === 0;
    if (nextButton) nextButton.hidden = currentStep === steps.length - 1;
    if (submitButton) submitButton.hidden = currentStep !== steps.length - 1;
    if (formStatus) formStatus.textContent = '';
  };

  const createPayload = () => ({
    property: {
      comune: valueOf('comune'),
      provincia: valueOf('provincia'),
      cap: valueOf('cap'),
      tipologia: valueOf('tipologia'),
      anno: valueOf('anno'),
      piani: valueOf('piani'),
    },
    observations: {
      dove: valueOf('dove'),
      internoEsterno: valueOf('internoEsterno'),
      orientamento: valueOf('orientamento'),
      comparsa: valueOf('comparsa'),
      cambiamenti: valueOf('cambiamenti'),
      porteFinestre: valueOf('porteFinestre'),
      pavimenti: valueOf('pavimenti'),
      lavori: valueOf('lavori'),
      infiltrazioni: valueOf('infiltrazioni'),
      note: valueOf('note'),
    },
    request: valueOf('richiesta'),
    contact: {
      nome: valueOf('nome'),
      email: valueOf('email'),
      telefono: valueOf('telefono'),
    },
    forwardingConsent: Boolean(form?.querySelector('[name="consensoInoltro"]:checked')),
  });

  const addSummaryRow = (label, value) => {
    if (!summaryList) return;
    const term = document.createElement('dt');
    const detail = document.createElement('dd');
    term.textContent = label;
    detail.textContent = displayValue(value);
    summaryList.append(term, detail);
  };

  const renderSummary = (payload) => {
    if (!summaryList) return;
    summaryList.replaceChildren();
    addSummaryRow('Comune e provincia', `${payload.property.comune} (${payload.property.provincia})`);
    addSummaryRow('CAP', payload.property.cap);
    addSummaryRow('Tipologia immobile', payload.property.tipologia);
    addSummaryRow('Anno approssimativo', payload.property.anno);
    addSummaryRow('Numero di piani', payload.property.piani);
    addSummaryRow('Dove sono le crepe', payload.observations.dove);
    addSummaryRow('Interne o esterne', payload.observations.internoEsterno);
    addSummaryRow('Orientamento', payload.observations.orientamento);
    addSummaryRow('Quando sono comparse', payload.observations.comparsa);
    addSummaryRow('Cambiamenti percepiti', payload.observations.cambiamenti);
    addSummaryRow('Porte o finestre', payload.observations.porteFinestre);
    addSummaryRow('Pavimenti apparentemente fuori livello', payload.observations.pavimenti);
    addSummaryRow('Lavori recenti', payload.observations.lavori);
    addSummaryRow('Infiltrazioni o umidità', payload.observations.infiltrazioni);
    addSummaryRow('Note', payload.observations.note);
    addSummaryRow('Tipo di richiesta', payload.request);
    addSummaryRow('Nome', payload.contact.nome);
    addSummaryRow('Email', payload.contact.email);
    addSummaryRow('Telefono', payload.contact.telefono);
    addSummaryRow('Consenso a eventuale inoltro', payload.forwardingConsent ? 'Sì' : 'No');
  };

  nextButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (validateStep()) showStep(Math.min(currentStep + 1, steps.length - 1));
  });

  backButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    showStep(Math.max(currentStep - 1, 0));
  });

  form?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
    event.preventDefault();
    if (!validateStep()) return;
    const payload = createPayload();
    const result = await adapter.submit(payload);
    renderSummary(payload);
    if (summary) summary.hidden = false;
    if (form) form.hidden = true;
    if (summaryNote) {
      summaryNote.textContent = result.forwardingRequested
        ? 'Hai espresso il consenso all’eventuale inoltro. In questa versione il riepilogo resta in modalità demo e non viene inoltrato a partner.'
        : 'Non hai espresso il consenso all’inoltro. In questa versione il riepilogo resta in modalità demo e non viene inviato.';
    }
    summary?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
  });

  restartButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (summary) summary.hidden = true;
    if (form) form.hidden = false;
    showStep(0);
    form?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
  });

  showStep(0);
</script>

<style>
  .lead-page { background: var(--paper); }
  .lead-hero { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
  .lead-hero-inner { padding-block: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); }
  .lead-hero h1 { max-width: 13ch; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6.4rem); }
  .lead-intro { max-width: 42rem; margin: 2rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 2vw, 1.4rem); line-height: 1.65; }
  .lead-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(15rem, 20rem); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem); align-items: start; padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
  .lead-main { min-width: 0; }
  .lead-form, .summary-card { padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 1.1rem; background: var(--surface); }
  .form-progress { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .progress-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .progress-heading .eyebrow { margin: 0; }
  .progress-track { height: 0.35rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface-alt); }
  .progress-track span { display: block; width: 25%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: var(--accent); transition: width 180ms ease; }
  .form-status { min-height: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  fieldset { margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  fieldset[hidden] { display: none; }
  legend { color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.06em; line-height: 1; }
  .fieldset-intro { margin: 1rem 0 2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.2rem; }
  .field { min-width: 0; }
  .field-wide { grid-column: span 2; }
  .field-full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  label { display: block; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: 0.86rem; font-weight: 750; }
  label > span, .choice-card input:required + span::after { color: var(--accent); }
  input:not([type='radio']):not([type='checkbox']), select, textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 0.5rem; padding: 0.8rem 0.85rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.55rem; background: #fffefa; color: var(--ink); font: inherit; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  textarea { min-height: 7rem; resize: vertical; }
  input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid rgb(186 116 73 / 35%); outline-offset: 2px; border-color: var(--accent); }
  input:invalid:not(:placeholder-shown), select:invalid, textarea:invalid:not(:placeholder-shown) { border-color: #a95a4b; }
  .choice-list { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .choice-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0.8rem; align-items: start; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.7rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .choice-card:hover, .choice-card:has(input:focus-visible) { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .choice-card input { margin: 0.2rem 0 0; accent-color: var(--brand); }
  .choice-card span { display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; }
  .choice-card strong { color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .choice-card small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  .consent-box { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1.2rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .checkbox-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0.7rem; align-items: start; color: var(--ink); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; }
  .checkbox-row input { margin-top: 0.2rem; accent-color: var(--brand); }
  .consent-box p { margin: 0.8rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .form-actions { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.8rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .form-actions .button:only-child { margin-left: auto; }
  .button { cursor: pointer; }
  .lead-aside { display: grid; gap: 1rem; position: sticky; top: 1.5rem; }
  .aside-card { padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 1rem; background: var(--surface-alt); }
  .aside-card h2 { max-width: 12ch; margin: 0; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.7rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.06em; }
  .aside-card p:not(.eyebrow) { margin: 1rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .aside-card .inline-link { margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .aside-note { padding: 1.2rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.8rem; }
  .aside-note strong { color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .aside-note p { margin: 0.5rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .summary-card[hidden] { display: none; }
  .summary-card h2 { max-width: 17ch; margin: 0; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -0.06em; }
  .summary-intro { max-width: 38rem; margin: 1.4rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .summary-card dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); margin: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .summary-card dt, .summary-card dd { margin: 0; padding: 0.8rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .summary-card dt { padding-right: 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
  .summary-card dd { color: var(--ink); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .summary-note { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.6rem; background: var(--surface-alt); color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .summary-card .button { width: auto; }
  noscript { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.6rem; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .lead-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .lead-aside { position: static; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .lead-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 14vw, 4.9rem); }
    .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .field-wide, .field-full { grid-column: auto; }
